Files in this folder are based on FreeType 2.14.3, with two security fixes
FreeType made after it:

- CVE-2026-50811, an out-of-bounds read in FT_Get_Var_Design_Coordinates
  (upstream commits 8fa928f1617aba65f45b00f0dcb109f077b7741e and
  5a280ecde6f324de0d226261036e736e0cb49a71; src/truetype/ttgxvar.c and
  src/type1/t1load.c);
- CVE-2026-95512, overlapping CID subroutines (upstream commit
  f3ca71c9900fe860849b3163a6e2c1e765b291d9; src/cid/cidload.c).

The source is Debian's freetype_2.14.3+dfsg.orig.tar.xz (FreeType's release
without the minified JavaScript of its HTML reference), checked against the
SHA-256 in Debian's freetype_2.14.3+dfsg-3.dsc; the two fixes are that
package's patches CVE-2026-50811.patch and CVE-2026-95512.patch.

OXT-Beyond's changes, each marked "OXT-Beyond":

- include/freetype/config/ftmodule.h registers the modules FreeType 2.10.4
  had, in its order (2.14.3's list adds the SDF and OT-SVG renderers);
- include/freetype/config/ftoption.h leaves FT_CONFIG_OPTION_SVG off.

Only the folders of src/ that 2.10.4 had are kept (not dlg, sdf or svg), and
include/dlg is left out (it is used only with FT_DEBUG_LOGGING).

Original source archives are available from
<https://download.savannah.gnu.org/releases/freetype/>
